SELECT r_check($q$ SELECT extra, count(*) AS n, sum(qty) AS s FROM r_t GROUP BY extra $q$);
NOTICE:  Table doesn't have 'DISTRIBUTED BY' clause. Creating a NULL policy entry.
NOTICE:  Table doesn't have 'DISTRIBUTED BY' clause. Creating a NULL policy entry.
